    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūkenaagūlwa bahangi balomolomo na balamya ba shiikolile",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū ng'hangi nūūlū munhū nooti wa shilooti wilonga, hūna wandya kwigīmba gīmba akoolechaga shimanīkījo na mihayo ya kūkumya, na ya kūkamaaja; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hama ng'hana ū mhayo gwa kūkumya nūūlū ū gwa kūkamaaja ūyo wagūhayaga gūshikīīla, hanuma ya henaho ūkūwīla, “Bebe tūbalondeelage bamulungu bangī”, (bamulungu abo ūtabamanile); na, “Twandyage kūbatūmamīla benabo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaya ū kwīdegeleka ī mihayo ya ng'hangi ng'wenūyo, nūūlū ū nooti wa shilooti ng'wenūyo. Nguno ū SEEBA Mulungu wing'we alīmugema, amulole ūlū muntogilwe na ng'holò ying'we yose na būpanga wing'we bose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bing'we īng'wigeleelile kūnondeela SEEBA Mulungu wing'we, na kūntūmamīla we wike. Ī shilagīlo shakwe shidimagi, hama nīyo mung'wigwe we. Ntūmamīlagi we wike, na mudimane nang'hwe mu welwa ng'holò. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ng'hangi ng'wenūyo nūūlū ū nooti wa shilooti, shiigelile abūlagwe. Nguno walomeelaga mihayo ya kūngomela ū SEEBA Mulungu wing'we, ūyo wang'wīnja mu sī ya Misili, ūmukomoola kūfuma mu sī ya būsese. Ū munhū ng'wenūyo alī na ng'hūmbū ja kūmugalūcha ng'wīleke ī nzīla īyo SEEBA Mulungu wing'we wamulagīla kwīlondeela. Shiigelile muwīnje gete ū būsoso ū mu bing'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū ndūgūyo nūūlū ng'witūnja wako, nūūlū nshīke wako; pye nūūlū ni akabiza ū nke wako ūyo ūntogilwe gete, nūūlū nwani ng'wiyo ūyo mutalekanaga, hūna ūkooba kūkūhūmbūūla alīkūwīla, “Tūjage kūūnū tūkabalamye bamulungu bangī,” (bamulungu abo ūtabamanile bebe, nūūlū bakūlūgenji bako; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bamulungu ba banhū abo mukwikalaga hamò nabo, bamò babo bazenganwa biching'wi, bangī ba kūle, basambaalile hose ū mu sī; kwandīja ipandī īlī kūshisha ipandī līngī,) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ū munhū ng'wenūyo ūtizūneka akūhūmbūūle, nīyo yaya nū kūndegeleka; hama ūtizūnsaatwa nūūlū hado, yaya ū kūneka alī mpanga, nūūlū ūtizūmisa gīkī atizinhwa nsango. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mūlagage gete ū ng'wenūyo; nīyo ū nkono gwako hū gūbize gwa kwandya ū mu kūmūlaga, hūna na a banhū a bangī batūūle ho a makono gabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mūlagage bo kūmponda mawe, nguno walī na ng'hūmbū ja kūkūgalūcha ūneke ū SEEBA Mulungu wako, ūyo wakwīnja mu sī ya Misili, ūkūfunya mu sī ya būsese. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu gīko a Baisilaeli a bose bakwigwa bogohe; na lūūlū atigela ūngī hangī ū mu bing'we wa kwīta mhayo gwabūbi gīko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūkenaagūlwa kwa mizengo ya balamya ba shiikolile",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu mizengo īyo SEEBA Mulungu wako alīkwinha kwikala mo, ūlū wigwa īlīhayiwa mu gūmò gwaho gīkī, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bigelile mo banhū ba nhūngwa ja malofu ū mu bing'we, bakūjaga būbahūmbūūla a banhū ba mu nzengo gwenūyo būbawīla, “Tūjagi tūkabalamye bamulungu bangī,” (bamulungu abo mutabamanile); ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a henaho īkūkwigeleela kūkooba mu būkomeezu wa kūbūūgīlīja chiza, na kūgīsīlīja mu welwa ng'holò. Ūlū gūbiza gūlī gwa ng'hana gūtī gwa būlomolomo, ū gwa gīkī mhayo gwa malofu gīko gwītilwe ū mu sī ya ng'wing'we, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a banhū ba mu nzengo gwenūyo ūkūbayagaja na būūgī bo līlūshū pye a bose. Ūkūgūkenaagūla pye gete ū nzengo gwenūyo, bashile a banhū nī mitugo ī jose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī shose īsho ūlashipandīke mo, shidimage ūshitūūge ha gatī gatī ya gwalugwa ya mu nzengo, hūna ūgūpembe moto pye ū nzengo nī shikolo shamo ī shose, shibize shakwinha sha kūpemva kūlī SEEBA Mulungu wako. Ū nzengo gwenūyo gūkwikala buyīkī gīko ilalī, atigela wa kūgūzenga hangī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shitizūbonwa mu nkono gwako shikolo shose shose sha ng'wenūmo, īsho shizumilwe. Ūlū ng'wīta gīko ū SEEBA akūgalūka būng'wīngīle ū būpelanu wakwe, amusaatwe na kūmuchīla shigongo. Akūng'ongeja ū wingī wing'we mukwīle mubize gīt'ūmo wabisagīja mu kūbilahīlīla a bakūlūgenji bing'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bing'we ng'wigwa ū SEEBA Mulungu wing'we, mushidime nī shilagīlo shakwe ī shose īsho nalīng'winha lelo, ng'wīte nī yīyo ītūngīlīgije ū mu miso gakwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
